1>Are silk scarves worth the investment?</h1>\n<p class=\"byline\">The ASYII Team</p>\n<p class=\"toc\"><a href=\"#why\">1. what you pay for</a> · <a href=\"#upgrade\">2. the upgrade</a> · <a href=\"#keep\">3. keep for years</a> · <a href=\"#entry\">4. entry point</a></p>\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>Sometimes.</b> A hand-rolled silk scarf costs more because of the edge, the silk and the time — not the label. It is worth it if you will actually wear it.</p><p class=\"lead\">The question is not whether silk is expensive. It is which piece earns its price in your wardrobe.</p>\n<h2 id=\"why\">You want to know what the money actually buys</h2>\n<p>A hand-rolled edge is sewn edge by edge rather than machine-finished — that is the main reason a good silk square costs more than a cheap one.</p><p>The silk itself matters too: how it falls, how it washes, and whether it still looks good in five years.</p>\n<div class=\"products\">\n{% assign prod = all_products['garden-veil-90cm-hand-rolled-silk-square-scarf-with-double-face-printed'] %}\n{% assign card_url = prod.url | append: '?utm_source=asyii&utm_medium=onsite&utm_campaign=are-silk-scarves-worth-the-investment&utm_content=garden-veil-90cm-hand-rolled-silk-square-scarf-with-double-face-printed' %}\n<div class=\"product\">\n<a class=\"pimg\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}\" alt=\"Garden Veil 90cm hand-rolled silk square\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pmeta\">{% if prod.compare_at_price > prod.price %}<span class=\"off\">{% assign pct = prod.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: prod.compare_at_price | round %}{{ 100 | minus: pct }}% off</span>{% endif %}<span class=\"variant\">Floral · 90cm</span></div>\n<a class=\"pname\" href=\"{{ card_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Garden Veil 90cm hand-rolled silk square</a>\n<p class=\"ppick\"><b>Pick this if</b> You want to see what the extra money buys — a hand-rolled edge and a large